      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Same problem on the Samsung Galaxy S23 in combination with the Jabra Talk 65.\n\nIt's like it doesn't switch to call mode like in discord mobile, so it's like in music mode and uses the phone microphone while still giving audio over the headset.\n\nI hope someone can find a workaround for this considering how long this has been an issue that still isn't fixed...\n\nIt would make the mobile version of VRChat so extremely useful on the go if this worked properly, or at least gave you the option to use the bluetooth mic ingame instead.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
